247	    /** The person's due-total: their counted claims' dues (with any late charge) added up, 0.00 with none; n/a when their grade
248	     *  in force on the day has no rate in force then, unless a counted claim keeps a figure: a fixed one (settled or bound), or a
249	     *  live one at another grade they had on its date, or one dated on or before the day (at a rate that has ended since). */
250	    public String dueTotal(List<Claim> claims, LocalDate today) {
251	        return dueTotal(claims, today, null);
252	    }
